        <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
        <div class="faq-accordion">
            
            <!-- Account & Registration Questions -->
            <div class="faq-category" data-category="account">
                <h3 class="mb-4 mt-5">Account & Registration</h3>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>How do I open a trading account with Kortex Prime?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Opening an account is quick and easy:</p>
                        <ol>
                            <li>Click "Sign Up" in the top navigation</li>
                            <li>Fill in your personal details (name, email, phone)</li>
                            <li>Complete the trading experience questionnaire</li>
                            <li>Verify your email address</li>
                            <li>Upload required identification documents</li>
                            <li>Make your first deposit</li>
                            <li>Start trading!</li>
                        </ol>
                        <p>The entire process typically takes 10-15 minutes. Account verification is usually completed within 24 hours.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>What documents do I need to verify my account?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>For account verification, we require:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Proof of Identity:</strong> Valid passport, driver's license, or national ID card</li>
                            <li><strong>Proof of Address:</strong> Recent utility bill, bank statement, or government letter (not older than 3 months)</li>
                            <li><strong>Proof of Payment:</strong> Copy of your credit/debit card (first 6 and last 4 digits visible) or bank account statement</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>All documents must be clear, colored copies showing all four corners. For security reasons, we cannot accept screenshots of documents.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>What is the minimum deposit required to start trading?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>The minimum deposit depends on your chosen account type:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Starter Account:</strong> $300 minimum deposit</li>
                            <li><strong>Silver Account:</strong> $1,000 minimum deposit</li>
                            <li><strong>Gold Account:</strong> $10,000 minimum deposit</li>
                            <li><strong>Platinum Account:</strong> $50,000 minimum deposit</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>We recommend starting with an amount you're comfortable with. You can always upgrade your account later as your trading grows.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>Do you offer demo accounts for practice?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes! We offer free demo accounts with $10,000 in virtual funds. The demo account:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Mirrors real market conditions</li>
                            <li>Includes all trading instruments</li>
                            <li>Provides access to all platform features</li>
                            <li>Is available for 30 days (can be extended)</li>
                            <li>Requires no deposit or commitment</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>To get a demo account, simply register on our platform and select "Demo Account" during the setup process.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Deposits & Withdrawals Questions -->
            <div class="faq-category" data-category="deposit">
                <h3 class="mb-4 mt-5">Deposits & Withdrawals</h3>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>What payment methods do you accept for deposits?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>We accept multiple payment methods for your convenience:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Credit/Debit Cards:</strong> Visa, Mastercard, Maestro</li>
                            <li><strong>Bank Wire Transfer:</strong> Domestic and international transfers</li>
                            <li><strong>E-Wallets:</strong> Skrill, Neteller, PayPal, WebMoney</li>
                            <li><strong>Crypto Payments:</strong> Bitcoin, Ethereum, USDT, USDC</li>
                            <li><strong>Local Payment Methods:</strong> Available based on your region</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Most deposits are processed instantly (except bank wires which take 1-3 business days).</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>How long do withdrawals take to process?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Withdrawal processing times vary by method:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>E-Wallets:</strong> 0-24 hours</li>
                            <li><strong>Crypto Withdrawals:</strong> 0-12 hours (depends on blockchain confirmation)</li>
                            <li><strong>Credit/Debit Cards:</strong> 1-3 business days</li>
                            <li><strong>Bank Wire Transfer:</strong> 2-5 business days</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p><strong>Important:</strong> First-time withdrawals may take longer due to additional security checks. All withdrawals are processed during business hours (GMT 9:00-17:00).</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>Are there any fees for deposits or withdrawals?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Our fee structure is transparent:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Deposits:</strong> No fees from Kortex Prime (third-party fees may apply)</li>
                            <li><strong>Withdrawals:</strong> One free withdrawal per month, then $25 per withdrawal</li>
                            <li><strong>Inactivity Fee:</strong> $15 per month after 12 months of inactivity</li>
                            <li><strong>Currency Conversion:</strong> 0.5% fee for transactions in non-USD currencies</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Platinum account holders enjoy unlimited free withdrawals and no inactivity fees.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>Can I withdraw to a different account than I deposited from?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>For security reasons, we generally require withdrawals to be sent back to the original deposit method (AML policy). However:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>You can withdraw to a different bank account under the same name</li>
                            <li>Additional verification may be required</li>
                            <li>Wire transfers can be sent to any bank account in your name</li>
                            <li>Contact support for special cases or corporate accounts</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>This policy protects both you and our platform from fraudulent activities.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Trading Questions -->
            <div class="faq-category" data-category="trading">
                <h3 class="mb-4 mt-5">Trading Questions</h3>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>What's your average trade execution speed?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Our average execution speed is <strong>12 milliseconds</strong> (0.012 seconds). This includes:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Order transmission to liquidity providers</li>
                            <li>Price validation</li>
                            <li>Trade execution</li>
                            <li>Confirmation back to your platform</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>We maintain 99.99% uptime with redundant servers in London, New York, and Tokyo to ensure minimal latency regardless of your location.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="faq-item animate-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <h5>What trading platforms are available?</h5>
                        <div class="faq-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>We offer multiple trading platforms:</p>
                        <ul>
